Value Filldown router_id ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value Filldown local_asn (\d+)
Value Required prefix ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+/\d+)
Value nexthop ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value peer_ip ([0-9a-fA-F:.]+)
Value peer_asn (\d+)
Value local_pref (\d+)
Value med (\d+)
Value communities (\d+:\d+(?:\s+\d+:\d+)*)
Value large_communities (\d+:\d+:\d+(?:\s+\d+:\d+:\d+)*)
Value best (Best)
Value as_path (\d+(?:\s+\d+)*)
Value age (\S+)

Start
  ^BGP\s+Router\s+ID:${router_id}\s+AS:${local_asn}
  ^BGP\s+RIB-In\s+Entries -> Routes
  ^BGP\s+RIB-Out\s+Entries -> Routes
  ^Network\s*:\s+${prefix} -> Routes

Routes
  ^Network\s*:\s+${prefix}
  ^Nexthop\s*:\s+${nexthop}
  ^From\s*:\s+${peer_ip}
  ^Local\s+Pref\.\s*:\s+${local_pref}
  ^Atomic\s+Aggr\..*MED\s*:\s+${med}
  ^Community\s*:\s+${communities}\s*$$
  ^Large\s+Community:\s+${large_communities}\s*$$
  ^Flags\s*:\s+[^\n]*?${best}
  ^Flags\s*:\s+
  ^AS-Path\s*:\s+${as_path}\s*$$
  ^Peer\s+AS\s*:\s+${peer_asn}
  ^Age\s*:\s+${age} -> Record
  ^-+\s*$$
